Data sources
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Tor bridge lines collected and published by this tool are public
circumvention data obtained from:

  * The Tor Project BridgeDB        - https://bridges.torproject.org
  * The upstream community collector (Delta-Kronecker/Tor-Bridges-Collector)
  * The default snowflake / meek / conjure bridge lines shipped with Tor Browser

Tor bridge lines (addresses, fingerprints, transport parameters) are public
facts published by the Tor network and are not claimed as original work here.
